# Navigation Migration Phase 3 — COMPLETED ✅

All ~56 `NavigationLink(destination:)` and `NavigationLink(isActive:)` instances across 16 files have been converted to modern `NavigationLink(value:)` + `.navigationDestination(for:)` / `.navigationDestination(isPresented:)`. Build succeeds with zero remaining legacy patterns.

